    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36627" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξακ-τέον</span></b> , (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξάγω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2
				</span></i>
			) <i>one must put out of the way, kill,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὑτόν</span> M. Ant.<i><span class="en">
				3.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must lead out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (
